# Force HTTPS
http://noneapk.xyz/* https://noneapk.xyz/:splat 301!
http://www.noneapk.xyz/* https://noneapk.xyz/:splat 301!

# Normalize www → apex
https://www.noneapk.xyz/* https://noneapk.xyz/:splat 301!

# Do NOT add an SPA fallback rule here — Cloudflare Pages handles it
# automatically when there is no 404.html. Adding one here would break
# static assets (CSS/JS/data files would be served index.html).